## What is FOSSBilling?

FOSSBilling is a free and open source billing and client management solution for hosting providers. It supports a wide range of services including web hosting, domain registration, and more.

## Key Features

{% cardgrid stagger=true %}
{% card title="Hosting Management" icon="server" %}
Integrate with popular control panels like cPanel, Plesk, HestiaCP, and DirectAdmin.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Domain Registration" icon="globe" %}
Resell domains through multiple registrars including Namecheap and Netim.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Payment Processing" icon="credit-card" %}
Accept payments via PayPal, Stripe, and many other payment gateways.
{% /card %}
{% card title="Extensible" icon="puzzle" %}
Build custom modules, themes, and integrations using our comprehensive API.
{% /card %}
{% /cardgrid %}

## Get Started

Ready to get started? Check out our [Getting Started guide](/getting-started/) to learn how to install and configure FOSSBilling.
